{"id":"vod_md_3666","vodId":"3666","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"3月的狮子","name_cn":"3月的狮子","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"22集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230829-1/6289f4bbddca572142f0cbd935861c20.jpg"},"summary":"十七岁的桐山零（河西健吾 配音）是一名将棋棋士，悲惨的童年遭遇让他自幼便失去了家人，这么多年来一直背负着沉重的记忆独自生活，长此以往，零已经习惯了压抑自己的感情，在心房周围筑起了无法撼动的高墙。某日，零邂逅了川本家的三姐妹——温柔体贴，擅长照顾他人的大姐川本明里（茅野爱衣 配音）、个性开朗乐观，非常不擅长料理家事的二姐川本日向（花泽香菜 配音）和还在上托儿所稚气未脱的小妹川本桃（久野美咲 配音）。三姐妹的出现让零再度感受到了家的温暖，找回了久违的快乐。与此同时，二海堂晴信（冈本信彦 配音）、三角龙雪（杉田智和 配音）和松本一砂（本村昂 配音）等强劲对手的出现，亦令零燃起了对将棋的热爱于斗志。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-29 08:07:34","playable":true,"episodeCount":23,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/hI6ugUck/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/qkLNJD7t/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/HRv4AB8U/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/gSLvPRW6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/458EOTDM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/2UQ9gMWz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/90p1axGE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/PwhZvoJs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/AewDsGYl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/uFTImbAr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/stFfZJ1F/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/ra2L40zg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/tsytkGD4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/wjkkgXs2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/DboYNQnR/index.m3u